    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54997" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρκ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be fully sufficient</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χώρη οὐδεμία καταρκέει πάντα ἑωυτῇ
					παρέχουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὶ δὲ φῶς ἓν ἡλίου καταρκέσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					447
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰς παρασκευάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1.29c
				</span></i>
			: impers., <i>it is enough</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρκεῖ τοῦδε κεκλῆσθαι πατρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					86
				</span></i>
			.</div>
